---
title: "Gas Metal Arc Welding"
code: "WEL-160"
category: "welding"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Introduces semi-automatic welding processes with emphasis on practical application. Includes the study of filler wires, fluxes, and gases. Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 3 hours. Total 5 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
